{"id":"bu_hne","lemma":"Bühne","pos":"noun","rank":1507,"glosses":["stage (setting in which multiple actors interact and compete with one another, e.g. politically)","theater","scaffolding (elevated platform to stand on to access something)"],"ipa":"/ˈbyːnə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/De-B%C3%BChne.ogg/De-B%C3%BChne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Bühne","plural":"Bühnen"},"formAudio":{"Bühnen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-B%C3%BChnen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Bist du hinter die Bühne gegangen?","en":"Did you go backstage?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"behind, after"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"}]},{"text":"Sie singt ein Lied auf der Bühne.","en":"She is singing a song on the stage.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to sing","l":"singen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"song"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Runter von der Bühne!","en":"Get off the stage.","words":[{"g":"down"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie sie je auf der Bühne singen hören?","en":"Have you ever heard her sing on stage?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"ever"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"}]},{"text":"Alles ging reibungslos über die Bühne.","en":"Everything went smoothly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798087","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"smoothly"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}